   └─ pnpm install
"
`;

exports[`measure.acceptance.share given: [case8] a live measure of one fast acceptance file, at one width, beside a light peer when: [t0] the skill runs end to end then: the whole stdout, its box-bound values masked, reads as a human meets it 1`] = `
"🧮 measure.acceptance.share, at work (one full suite per width, so minutes, not seconds)
   ├─ the peer alone, 1 run
   ├─ width <N>%, the suite and the peer at work
   ├─ width <N>%, done in <N>s
   └─ measured

🧮 measure.acceptance.share
   ├─ box = <N> cores, baseline load <N>, baseline cpu psi <PSI>
   ├─ quiet = <QUIET>
   ├─ peer solo = <N>s (median of <N>)
   ├─ beside a live suite
   │  └─ width <N>%
   │     ├─ peer = <PEER>
   │     ├─ peak load = <N>, peak cpu psi = <PSI>
   │     └─ suite = <N>s, exit 0
   │
   └─ record = .log/role=any/skill=measure.acceptance.share/<STAMP>.json
"
`;
